  "_comment": "Patterns-only tray catalog. The Patterns editor (vortex/wall/src/pages/clinic/patterns/Patterns.jsx) does NOT use the shared shapeTypes.json catalog — that one drives Pathways. Here the bottom-pane tray is two levels deep: pick a `view` (History events → dropped onto the match sequence canvas, or Suggestions → dropped onto the suggestion slot), then a `family` within it, then drag a `type`. A type carrying `param` needs a value once it lands on a node: `appointmentType` (id from `appointmentTypes`), `specialty` (id from `specialties`), or `gap` (a { value, unit } from `gapUnits`). That chosen value is written back onto the node's `shape` and persisted with the pattern on Save. `emoji` renders inside the shape circle. `subfamily` on a family (e.g. suggestion calls are outgoing) seeds each dropped node's direction badge.",
